{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Dungeon Legend Party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dance in the whirlpool of death, and write your survival epic with blood!</strong> <br><i>\u201cWhen the ancient dungeon opens thousands of crimson eyes, only the most cunning survivors will witness the next dawn\u2026\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/2464d4d895495f452791057dc1419e37.gif?t=1747651673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/241bd1420686d56ba317c2828e6279d3.png?t=1747651673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Core Gameplay\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a dungeon style roguelike adventure game. <br>\ud83d\udd25 Weave a web of survival with evasive maneuvers and ignite counter-storms with skills amidst 360-degree demonic onslaughts! Each 15-30-minute life-or-death roulette challenges your real-time decision-making and\u00a0Operation wow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(<i>Star Burst Stream!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/xuanchuan3.gif?t=1747651673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Shop System\u3011</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use currency to purchase <strong>skill tomes</strong> and learn otherworldly abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy <strong>healing items</strong> to save yourself from the brink of death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend <strong>hellish skeleton coins</strong> to challenge infernal bosses and claim <strong>epic gear</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Legendary Characters\u3011</strong> <br>\ud83c\udfad Choose your survival avatar:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cyber Swordsman \u201cBlade Draw\u201d</strong> \u2013 Unleash wide-range sword slashes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Primordial Man \u201cAwakening\u201d</strong> \u2013 Grow stronger in three attributes with each activation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AK47 Chicken \u201cCluckfire\u201d</strong> \u2013 Rain down rapid-fire bullet barrages <br>Each character boasts unique ultimate skills. Mix and match skills from shop tomes to craft your ultimate build!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/xuanchuan1.gif?t=1747651673\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Breath of Blood!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Game Art\u3011</strong> <br>Where flesh and machinery merge into cosmic horror! <br>Carve lethal geometries in space with bullet-hell patterns. <br>Every boss battle is a <strong>dynamic art exhibition</strong> \u2013 when the screen trembles under millions of damage numbers, you\u2019ll grasp the true meaning of <strong>violent aesthetics</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cRemember: In this subterranean labyrinth, survival isn\u2019t the goal\u2014conquering death in the most spectacular fashion is the only true legend!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(guitar hero!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546660/extras/xuanchuan2.gif?t=1747651673\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546660?t=1747651673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/